OL,3,GNEWSAWoman with terminal cancer gets
OL,4,Adream wedding on hospital ward
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman with a terminal cancer
OL,7,Fdiagnosis married her partner of 15
OL,8,Fyears in the hospital where she is
OL,9,Freceiving palliative care - and her
OL,10,Fhorses even made the ceremony.
OL,12,FMaggie Heginbothom, 68, who has
OL,13,Fadvanced liver cancer, thanked staff at
OL,14,FYsbyty Gwynedd in Bangor for organising
OL,15,Fa wedding ceremony on Monday, just two
OL,16,Fdays after her partner Mark proposed.
OL,18,FThe horse lover and former clinical
OL,19,Fscientist with Public Health Wales,
OL,20,Fdescribed hospital staff as being "like
OL,21,Ffamily to me".
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,433,430,260,140,0,100
